{"type":"message","id":"3ba87c6e","parentId":"ecb8e78a","timestamp":"2026-04-07T00:59:14.566Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to analyze which of the ~7000 notes not in knowledge bases are worth moving into knowledge bases. Let me spawn a subagent to analyze a sample of notes that are not in knowledge bases (topics=[]).\n\nFrom the first page we saw, the notes with \"topics\":[] are not in any knowledge base. Let me analyze more pages to get a representative sample and identify high-value notes that should be moved to knowledge bases.","thinkingSignature":"20b4b7f94db71a4257c756f95367e6d90c553c3b9e328a6c8bc404486e6b8acc"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_4tprvvwruuw6_1","name":"sessions_spawn","arguments":{"task":"分析Get笔记中未入知识库的笔记，识别哪些值得移入知识库。\n\n背景：\n- 笔记总数7367篇\n- 已入知识库351篇\n- 未入知识库约7000篇（这些笔记的 topics 字段为空数组）\n\n目标：采样分析未入库笔记，找出值得入库的高价值内容。\n\n执行步骤：\n1. 调用 GET https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/note/list?since_id=0 获取多页笔记\n2. 筛选出 topics=[] 或 topics 为空的笔记（这些是未入库的）\n3. 至少翻5页（100条），收集足够样本\n4. 对每条笔记评估：\n   - 内容长度（>500字有价值）\n   - 内容类型（播客/录音卡/系统生成/原创）\n   - 主题领域（芯片/投资/AI/教育/生活）\n   - 复用频率（系统备份/复盘 vs 一次性记录）\n5. 分类输出：\n   - ✅ 值得入库的笔记（按知识库分类）\n   - ⚠️ 价值一般但可保留的\n   - ❌ 不值得入库的（系统自动生成的一次性报告）\n6. 写入分析结果到 /tmp/unorganized_notes_analysis.md\n\nAPI认证：\n- Authorization: gk_live_79414cc5d34021a6.f48b009c9ed9470d05fbec8f4ef919f4d657e7a15d91347a\n- X-Client-ID: cli_a1b2c3d4e5f6789012345678abcdef90\n\n重点：找到那些散落的\"金子\"——有深度内容的播客笔记、录音卡转写、方法论记录等。","label":"kb-unorganized-analysis","runtime":"subagent","mode":"run"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":130,"output":520,"cacheRead":65405,"cacheWrite":29200,"totalTokens":95255,"cost":{"input":0.000039,"output":0.000624,"cacheRead":0.0039242999999999995,"cacheWrite":0.01095,"total":0.015537299999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775523536668,"responseId":"062389d1b1bb0b623fdcf255f56b6981"}}
