{"type":"message","id":"adcb3296","parentId":"eaaa9abf","timestamp":"2026-04-07T01:39:12.550Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants to execute P0 first: create the two new knowledge bases and start migrating the first batch of notes. Let me execute this in parallel.\n\nP0 tasks:\n1. Create 「OpenClaw使用」 knowledge base\n2. Create 「家庭教育」 knowledge base\n3. Start migrating notes to the appropriate KBs\n\nLet me create both KBs first, then figure out which notes to migrate.\n\nThe KB IDs:\n- New: OpenClaw使用 (need to create)\n- New: 家庭教育 (need to create)\n- Existing: 芯片业务相关 (9YeBam0m)\n- Existing: AI使用技巧 (eYzm44nm)\n\n\n- Existing: 投资与金融 (Q0GlxgqJ)\n\nNow I'm ready to create the two new knowledge bases simultaneously.","thinkingSignature":"5be8c55b5da817169ff09899ad34a946a3d9d6685b4237d73a269a553f195f1b"},{"type":"text","text":"好，先建两个新KB！\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_d8rnx1om2n0i_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"export GETNOTE_API_KEY=\"gk_live_79414cc5d34021a6.f48b009c9ed9470d05fbec8f4ef919f4d657e7a15d91347a\"\nexport GETNOTE_CLIENT_ID=\"cli_a1b2c3d4e5f6789012345678abcdef90\"\n\n# 创建「OpenClaw使用」知识库\necho \"=== 创建 OpenClaw使用 ===\"\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/knowledge/create\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: $GETNOTE_API_KEY\" \\\n  -H \"X-Client-ID: $GETNOTE_CLIENT_ID\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"name\":\"OpenClaw使用\",\"description\":\"OpenClaw配置教程、Skills推荐、多Agent方案、使用方法论\",\"cover\":\"\"}'"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_d8rnx1om2n0i_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"export GETNOTE_API_KEY=\"gk_live_79414cc5d34021a6.f48b009c9ed9470d05fbec8f4ef919f4d657e7a15d91347a\"\nexport GETNOTE_CLIENT_ID=\"cli_a1b2c3d4e5f6789012345678abcdef90\"\n\n# 创建「家庭教育」知识库\necho \"=== 创建 家庭教育 ===\"\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/knowledge/create\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: $GETNOTE_API_KEY\" \\\n  -H \"X-Client-ID