{"type":"message","id":"80f8bc77","parentId":"308d64ed","timestamp":"2026-04-07T01:39:32.722Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Both KBs created successfully. Now I need to:\n1. OpenClaw使用 (G0P1Z51J) - migrate OpenClaw-related notes from AI使用技巧\n2. 家庭教育 (EJX1r7bn) - migrate daughter education notes\n\nBut I need to find the actual note_ids to migrate. The subagent found some notes but I need to get the actual note IDs. Let me search for the specific notes mentioned.\n\nFrom the subagent analysis, the high-value notes to migrate are:\nOpenClaw相关（to OpenClaw使用）:\n\n\n- OpenClaw金融场景十大核心Skills深度解析\n- OpenClaw多Agent配置指南\n- OpenClaw养虾一个月总结\n\n家庭教育（to 家庭教育）:\n- 八年级下册语文生字词听写备考\n- 物理与英语习题讲题讨论记录\n- 关于课外补课换老师的讨论\n\nI need to search for these specific notes to get their note_ids. Let me use the recall/search API or list through notes to find them. The note_ids from the earlier data sample I saw include the Chinese language study notes and other records I should locate.\n\nActually, I'm realizing the note_ids like 1906179784950718192 are already in the 孩子教育 KB. Rather than trying to batch add by note_ids across different sources, I should take a simpler approach: have the subagent scan through unorganized notes page by page to identify which ones belong in each category, then batch add them to the right KBs. This is more reliable than searching for individual notes.\n\nFor now, I'll start with what I can do: batch add notes to the two new KBs using the note_ids I've already found. I have some OpenClaw notes from the analysis and some education notes from the page 1 sample, so let me begin with those and spawn a subagent to handle the larger unorganized notes inventory. I need to verify which notes are actually available before attempting to batch add them—let me query the API directly for the specific note IDs I've identified. For now I'll share the created KBs with the user and clarify what still needs to be done to populate them with actual notes.","thinkingSignature":"b148a38686cebc90d5ad487cbf4ef13c859b6721c17fb752b52e7b2b08514ba3"},{"type":"text","text":"✅ 两个新KB创建成功！\n\n| 新知识库 | ID | 描述 |\n|---------|-----|------|\n| **OpenClaw使用** | G0P1Z51J | OpenClaw配置/Skills/多Agent/方法论 |\n| **家庭教育** | EJX1r7bn | 兮兮学习辅导/中考备考/补课/成长记录 |\n\n---\n\n**接下来要把笔记移进去。** 我需要从7000+条散放笔记里找出属于这两个KB的内容，然后把笔记ID移进去。\n\n这个工作量比较大——需要扫描多页笔记找到目标笔记，然后批量移入。\n\n**有两种方式：**\n\n**A. 我全自动执行**（无需你确认，我直接扫描+迁移，但需要较长时间）\n\n**B. 我先列清单，你确认后执行**（更快，每批列10-20篇你确认再移）\n\n选哪种？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":60869,"output":635,"cacheRead":40516,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":102020,"cost":{"input":0.018260699999999998,"output":0.000762,"cacheRead":0.00243096,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.021453659999999996}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775525953207,"responseId":"06239341108ba283e9eebc18506c1c38"}}
