{"type":"message","id":"40cceb27","parentId":"b71d5344","timestamp":"2026-04-07T01:41:08.414Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"User wants me to execute automatically (Option A). I need to:\n\n1. Scan through the unorganized notes to find notes that belong to:\n   - OpenClaw使用 (G0P1Z51J) - OpenClaw skills, configuration, methods\n   - 家庭教育 (EJX1r7bn) - daughter-related study辅导, exams, etc.\n\n2. Move them into the respective KBs using the batch-add API\n\nThe batch-add API takes:\n- topic_id: the KB ID\n- note_ids: array of note IDs (max 20 per batch)\n\nI need to:\n1. Get note list pages\n2. Filter notes with topics=[] (unorganized)\n3. Identify which notes should go to which KB based on title/content/tags\n4. Batch add to the appropriate KB\n\nLet me start scanning. I'll write a script that:\n1. Gets pages of notes\n2. Identifies relevant notes\n3. Moves them in batches\n\nLet me start with finding OpenClaw notes first, then 家庭教育 notes.","thinkingSignature":"59b8802658b3b37f4d4cd599fd8d8eca8b0048424c9e4da9cb138bc4495e1ee8"},{"type":"text","text":"好，全自动执行，开始扫描迁移！\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_su9txtus479q_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"export GETNOTE_API_KEY=\"gk_live_79414cc5d34021a6.f48b009c9ed9470d05fbec8f4ef919f4d657e7a15d91347a\"\nexport GETNOTE_CLIENT_ID=\"cli_a1b2c3d4e5f6789012345678abcdef90\"\nOPENCLAW_KB=\"G0P1Z51J\"\nFAMILY_KB=\"EJX1r7bn\"\n\necho \"开始扫描笔记并迁移...\"\n\n# 扫描5页（100条笔记），找出属于OpenClaw使用和家庭教育的笔记\nfor page in 1 2 3 4 5; do\n  echo \"=== 扫描第${page}页 ===\"\n  result=$(curl -s \"https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/note/list?since_id=0\" \\\n    -H \"Authorization: $GETNOTE_API_KEY\" \\\n    -H \"X-Client-ID: $GETNOTE_CLIENT_ID\")\n  \n  echo \"$result\" | python3 -c \"\nimport sys,json,re\n\ntext = sys.stdin.read()\nsafe = re.sub(r'\\\"(id|note_id|next_cursor|parent_id|follow_id|live_id)\\\"\\s*:\\s*(\\d+)', r'\\\"\\1\\\":\\\"\\2\\\"', text)\ndata = json.loads(safe)\n\nif data.get('success'):\n    notes = data.get('data',{}).get('notes',[])\n    for n in notes:\n        title = n.get('title','')\n        nid = n.get('note_id','')\n        tags = [t['name'] for t in n.get('tags',[])]\n        topics = n.get('topics',[])\n        \n        # 只处理未入库的笔记\n        if topics:\n            continue\n            \n        # OpenClaw相关关键词\n        oc_keywords = ['OpenClaw','Skill','skills','插件','配置','Agent','多Agent','定时任务','cron','工作流','自动化']\n        # 家庭教育相关关键词\n        fam_keywords = ['女儿','兮兮','英语','语文','数学','物理','化学','中考','学习辅导','补课','习题','错题','考试','期中','期末','八年级','七年级']\n        \n        is_oc = any(kw.lower() in title.lower() or any(kw.lower() in t.lower() for t in tags) for kw in oc_keywords)\n        is_fam = any(kw in title or any(kw in t for t in tags) for kw in fam_keywords)\n        \n        if is_oc or is_fam:\n            kb = 'OpenClaw' if is_oc else '家庭'\n            print(f'{kb}|{nid}|{title[:50]}')\n\"\ndone","timeout":60}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":130,"output":843,"cacheRead":100318,"cacheWrite":1208,"totalTokens":102499,"cost":{"input":0.000039,"output":0.0010115999999999999,"cacheRead":0.00601908,"cacheWrite":0.000453,"total":0.0075226799999999995}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775526045285,"responseId":"0623939de3e585b482ccedb9856306ed"}}
