{"type":"message","id":"52ea02d9","parentId":"b5ac5605","timestamp":"2026-04-07T01:42:13.585Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see the issue - the same notes are appearing multiple times across pages because the API doesn't paginate properly with since_id=0. I need to use the next_cursor to properly paginate. Also, the script has duplicates because it's scanning the same page multiple times.\n\nAlso, I notice the \"OpenClaw\" list includes daily backup reports which we said should NOT be migrated (they're on the cleanup list). I need to:\n1. Fix the pagination to use next_cursor\n2. Filter out the daily backup reports from OpenClaw migration list\n3. Deduplicate the results\n\nLet me write a better script that properly paginates and filters.","thinkingSignature":"77736c4510e5c7d0972242c415a7cfe7baa68eafaafe5f705822dd4fee305eda"},{"type":"text","text":"页面有重复，我来修复分页逻辑并过滤掉不该迁移的备份报告：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_2rx64g8crjp6_1","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/tmp/migrate_v2.sh","content":"#!/bin/bash\nexport GETNOTE_API_KEY=\"gk_live_79414cc5d34021a6.f48b009c9ed9470d05fbec8f4ef919f4d657e7a15d91347a\"\nexport GETNOTE_CLIENT_ID=\"cli_a1b2c3d4e5f6789012345678abcdef90\"\n\npython3 << 'PYEOF'\nimport subprocess, json, re, time\n\nOPENCLAW_KB = \"G0P1Z51J\"\nFAMILY_KB = \"EJX1r7bn\"\n\noc_notes = set()  # (note_id, title) - 用set去重\nfam_notes = set()\n\n# 过滤词：不该迁移的\nEXCLUDE_OC = ['备份报告', '备份记录', '每日复盘', '每日备份', '发芽报告']\n# 过滤词：不该迁移到OpenClaw的（家庭/生活类）\nEXCLUDE_FAM = ['打牌', '餐饮', '闲聊', '聚餐', '出行', '德甲', '足球']\n\ndef fetch_page(cursor=\"0\"):\n    if cursor == \"0\":\n        url = 'https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/note/list?since_id=0'\n    else:\n        url = f'https://openapi.biji.com/open/api/v1/resource/note/list?since_id={cursor}'\n    \n    result = subprocess.run([\n        'curl', '-s', url,\n        '-H', 'Authorization: gk_live_79414cc5d34021a6.f48b009c9ed9470d05fbec8f4ef919f4d657e7a15d91347a',\n        '-H', 'X-Client-ID: cli_a1b2c3d4e5f6789012345678abcdef90'\n    ], capture_output=True, text=True)\n    \n    safe = re.sub(r'\"(id|note_id|next_cursor|parent_id|follow_id|live_id)\"\\s*:\\s*(\\d+)', \n                  r'\"\\1\":\"\\2\"', result.stdout)\n    return json.loads(safe)\n\n# 正确分页：用next_cursor\ncursor = \"0\"\npage = 0\nseen_ids = set()\n\nwhile page < 20:  # 最多20页=400条\n    page += 1\n    print(f\"扫描第{page}页 (cursor={cursor[:20]}...)\")\n    \n    data = fetch_page(cursor)\n    if not data.get('success'):\n        print(f\"  API错误: {data.get('error')}\")\n        break\n    \n    notes = data.get('data', {}).get('notes', [])\n    has_more = data.get('data', {}).get('has_more', False)\n    next_cursor = data.get('data', {}).get('next_cursor', '')\n    \n    if not notes:\n        print(\"  无笔记，停止\")\n        break\n    \n    new_count = 0\n    for n in notes:\n        nid = n.get('note_id', '')\n        if nid in seen_ids:\n            continue\n        seen_ids.add(nid)\n        new_count += 1\n        \n        title = n.get('title', '') or ''\n        tags = [t['name'] for t in n.get('tags', [])]\n        topics = n.get('topics', [])\n        \n        # 已入库的跳过\n        if topics:\n            continue\n        \n        # OpenClaw相关（排除备份报告）\n        oc_keywords = ['OpenClaw', 'Skill', 'skills', 'Agent', '多Agent', 'cron', '定时任务']\n        is_oc = any(kw.lower() in title.lower() or any(kw.lower() in t.lower() for t in tags) for kw in oc_keywords)\n        is_excluded_oc = any(ex in title for ex in EXCLUDE_OC)\n        \n        if is_oc and not is_excluded_oc:\n            oc_notes.add((nid, title[:70]))\n            print(f\"  ✓ [OpenClaw] {title[:50]}\")\n        \n        # 家庭教育相关\n        fam_keywords = ['女儿', '兮兮', '英语', '语文', '数学', '物理', '化学', '中考', '学习辅导', \n                       '补课', '习题', '错题', '考试', '期中', '期末', '八年级', '字词', '听写', '发芽报告']\n        is_fam = any(kw in title or any(kw in t for t in tags) for kw in fam_keywords)\n        is_excluded_fam = any(ex in title for ex in EXCLUDE_FAM)\n        \n        if is_fam and not is_excluded_fam:\n            fam_notes.add((nid, title[:70]))\n            print(f\"  ✓ [家庭教育] {title[:50]}\")\n    \n    print(f\"  新笔记: {new_count}篇, 累计: OpenClaw {len(oc_notes)} / 家庭 {len(fam_notes)}\")\n    \n    if not has_more or not next_cursor:\n        print(\"  无更多页，停止\")\n        break\n    \n    cursor = next_cursor\n    time.sleep(0.3)  # 避免太快\n\nprint(f\"\\n=== 扫描完成 ===\")\nprint(f\"OpenClaw相关(去重): {len(oc_notes)}篇\")\nprint(f\"家庭教育相关(去重): {len(fam_notes)}篇\")\n\n# 保存\nwith open('/tmp/oc_to_migrate.txt', 'w') as f:\n    for nid, title in sorted(oc_notes):\n        f.write(f\"{nid}|{title}\\n\")\n\nwith open('/tmp/fam_to_migrate.txt', 'w') as f:\n    for nid, title in sorted(fam_notes):\n        f.write(f\"{nid}|{title}\\n\")\n\nprint(\"\\n已保存待迁移列表\")\nPYEOF"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":66447,"output":1443,"cacheRead":40516,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":108406,"cost":{"input":0.0199341,"output":0.0017316,"cacheRead":0.00243096,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02409666}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775526102590,"responseId":"062393d7d647eab6c35fe9f70d9171fc"}}
