{"type":"message","id":"b77e99e4","parentId":"ea922891","timestamp":"2026-04-07T02:37:03.577Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to also migrate the content from those 7 Feishu documents back into Getnote. But wait - these documents were created FROM Getnote notes, so the content is already in Getnote. The subagent extracted content from Getnote notes and created Feishu docs from them.\n\nActually, looking at the situation more carefully:\n1. The subagent was supposed to migrate Getnote notes to Getnote KBs (G0P1Z51J, EJX1r7bn, 9YeBam0m)\n2. Instead, it created Feishu documents with the content\n3. The user now wants these Feishu documents' content put back into Getnote\n\nBut this is circular - the content came FROM Getnote. The subagent extracted the note content and created Feishu docs. The original Getnote notes should still exist.\n\nI think what the user might mean is: the 7 Feishu docs contain consolidated/organized content from multiple Getnote notes. He wants these organized docs also saved back to Getnote as reference notes.\n\nBut actually, the simpler interpretation is: he wants me to use the Feishu doc content and save it as new notes in Getnote. Let me fetch the 7 Feishu docs and save their content as notes in Getnote.\n\nThe 7 docs are:\n1. AI工具用法荟萃 - OYJqwel5niiPmPk5JUxcJ2Mvn5f\n2. 关税战与中美经济博弈 - E3ybw8uVXiJd1EkobkxcvAlZnXb\n3. 家庭教育方法与AI辅助 - I2YuwsFvnibUgvk5cdxcwWEEnmb\n\n\n4. 芯片与半导体：出口管制与EAR知识 - TSqTwlZkTiQHoEkMnWmccIYlnGf\n5. 从历史推测关税战的未来走向（施展） - Wrk0wfWy6i25IYk10mJcJoTrn0g\n6. 变革管理方法论 - B2k9w5xlYiaGl4kBIjtcIsdjnhb\n7. 半导体出口管制动态 - LQSRw1aTiijm9GkgLOZcjE2ynwb\n\nI need to fetch each of these documents and extract their content, then create new notes in Getnote with that organized material.","thinkingSignature":"7a5a3b57ad783b6bb5f6867bd11117495ae315a6cad453e5fc297513bb578380"},{"type":"text","text":"好，先看看这7个飞书文档的内容：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_zmuvnze1ywo6_1","name":"feishu_fetch_do