{"type":"message","id":"ac447928","parentId":"5b304ff3","timestamp":"2026-04-07T11:28:39.625Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_56vdbqwb562y_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"enabled\": true,\n  \"requireMention\": true,\n  \"appId\": \"cli_a93534f5edb85bd3\",\n  \"appSecret\": \"6164wgLUMqCMAL6rOATCDdwxvnYRRVV0\",\n  \"connectionMode\": \"websocket\",\n  \"domain\": \"feishu\",\n  \"groupPolicy\": \"open\",\n  \"allowFrom\": [\n    \"*\"\n  ],\n  \"webhookPath\": \"/feishu/events\",\n  \"dmPolicy\": \"pairing\",\n  \"reactionNotifications\": \"own\",\n  \"typingIndicator\": true,\n  \"resolveSenderNames\": true\n}"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":91,"aggregated":"{\n  \"enabled\": true,\n  \"requireMention\": true,\n  \"appId\": \"cli_a93534f5edb85bd3\",\n  \"appSecret\": \"6164wgLUMqCMAL6rOATCDdwxvnYRRVV0\",\n  \"connectionMode\": \"websocket\",\n  \"domain\": \"feishu\",\n  \"groupPolicy\": \"open\",\n  \"allowFrom\": [\n    \"*\"\n  ],\n  \"webhookPath\": \"/feishu/events\",\n  \"dmPolicy\": \"pairing\",\n  \"reactionNotifications\": \"own\",\n  \"typingIndicator\": true,\n  \"resolveSenderNames\": true\n}","cwd":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775561319603}}
{"type":"message","id":"6b935c61","parentId":"ac447928","timestamp":"2026-04-07T11:28:57.051Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"让我分析一下这个配置的潜在问题：\n\n1. **allowFrom: [\"*\"]** - 允许所有人，这是个风险点\n2. **groupPolicy: \"open\"** - 群聊开放，任何人发消息都会响应\n3. **dmPolicy: \"pairing\"** - 私聊需要配对，这个是安全的\n4. **requireMention: true** - 现在需要@，这个是好的\n5. **reactionNotifications: \"own\"** - 只通知自己的反应，中性\n6. **resolveSenderNames: true** - 解析发送者名称，中性\n\n主要风险点：\n1. **groupPolicy: \"open\"** + **allowFrom: [\"*\"]** - 在群里任何人都能和你交互，这可能不是你想要的\n2. 群聊中任何人@机器人都能触发响应\n3. AppSecret是完整的，需要保护好\n\n建议：\n1. 群聊策略改为 allowlist 或 deny，明确定义哪些群可以使用\n2. allowFrom 应该限制来源，比如只有特定用户可以访问\n\n让我给频哥一个分析报告。","thinkingSignature":"f80c7baa121ed1ea5d907cb9fd185399d6b6bb01811ec1db8f355d24d456c362"},{"type":"text","text":"## 飞书渠道配置风险分析\n\n| 配置项 | 当前值 | 风险等级 | 说明 |\n|--------|--------|----------|------|\n| `allowFrom` | `[\"*\"]` | 🔴 高 | 允许任何人访问 |\n| `groupPolicy` | `\"open\"` | 🔴 高 | 任何群/任何人都能触发响应 |\n| `dmPolicy` | `\"pairing\"` | 🟢 低 | 私聊需配对，安全 |\n| `requireMention` | `true` | 🟢 低 | 需@才响应，降低误触发 |\n| `connectionMode` | `\"websocket\"` | 🟢 低 | 长连接，稳定 |\n\n---\n\n### 主要风险点\n\n**1. 群聊开放 + 任意来源（🔴 高风险）**\n```\ngroupPolicy: \"open\"  +  allowFrom: [\"*\"]\n```\n- 任何飞书群里的任何人都能和你交互\n- 群成员@机器人就能触发，无需验证身份\n- 如果你加入了陌生群，存在被陌生人滥用的风险\n\n**2. AppSecret 暴露在配置文件中**\n- `appSecret` 是完整值，虽然在本地文件，但建议定期轮换\n\n---\n\n### 建议优化\n\n**如果你只在特定群使用：**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"groupPolicy\": \"allowlist\",\n  \"allowFrom\": [\"oc_xxx群ID1\", \"oc_xxx群ID2\"]\n}\n```\n\n**如果你想完全禁止群聊交互：**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"groupPolicy\": \"deny\",\n  \"allowFrom\": []\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 当前状态判断\n\n| 场景 | 是否安全 |\n|------|---------|\n| 私聊（和频哥） | ✅ 安全，需配对 |\n|熟人多的群 | ⚠️ 基本安全，但任何人都能触发 |\n|陌生群/陌生人 | 🔴 风险较高 |\n\n---\n\n**建议**：你主要用私聊还是群聊？如果群聊用得多，建议改成白名单模式，只允许你指定的群使用。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":103384,"output":651,"cacheRead":40516,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":144551,"cost":{"input":0.0310152,"output":0.0007812,"cacheRead":0.00243096,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.034227360000000005}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775561319627,"responseId":"06241d67148c7a73b46e61d8681306dc"}}
