{"type":"message","id":"e5ae9d99","parentId":"854aaa2a","timestamp":"2026-04-07T14:58:35.294Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"授权成功了。但这是用户身份授权，我需要获取新的access token。让我重新从Keychain获取。","thinkingSignature":"d9816587a905c2eb7931adf9c74f1e81f1338ce9708fb9be0af40b4bbefbe9e7"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_o49h3ej1c1vy_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 重新获取token并上传\nsleep 2\nFULL_TOKEN=$(security find-generic-password -s \"openclaw-feishu-uat\" -a \"cli_a93534f5edb85bd3:ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\" -w 2>/dev/null)\nACCESS_TOKEN=$(echo \"$FULL_TOKEN\" | python3 -c \"import sys,json; d=json.load(sys.stdin); print(d.get('accessToken',''))\")\necho \"新token前20字符: ${ACCESS_TOKEN:0:20}\"\n\n# 上传图片1\nSIZE1=$(stat -f%z /tmp/geography_wrong1.jpg)\nRESULT1=$(curl -s -X POST \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/files/upload_all\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $ACCESS_TOKEN\" \\\n  -F \"file_name=geography_wrong1.jpg\" \\\n  -F \"parent_type=bitable_image\" \\\n  -F \"parent_node=TAxUbXUmKaXVuXsNWOacbP1Tne1\" \\\n  -F \"size=$SIZE1\" \\\n  -F \"file=@/tmp/geography_wrong1.jpg;type=image/jpeg\" \\\n  -F 'extra={\"bitablePerm\":{\"tableId\":\"Tbl8nVfnfFoGBVS\"}}')\necho \"图片1上传结果: $RESULT1\"","timeout":20}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":107453,"output":369,"cacheRead":40516,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":148338,"cost":{"input":0.0322359,"output":0.0004428,"cacheRead":0.00243096,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.03510966}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775573906706,"responseId":"06244e938f27937378b277a8c25d876d"}}
{"type":"message","id":"e22a40e9","parentId":"e5ae9d99","timestamp":"2026-04-07T14:58:37.893Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_o49h3ej1c1vy_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"新token前20字符: eyJhbGciOiJFUzI1NiIs\n图片1上传结果: {\"code\":99991677,\"msg\":\"Authentication token expired. Please request a new one.\",\"error\":{\"log_id\":\"20260407225837C0092AFBC77127D22D65\",\"troubleshooter\":\"排查建议查看(Troubleshooting suggestions): https://open.feishu.cn/search?from=openapi&log_id=20260407225837C0092AFBC77127D22D65&code=99991677&method_id=6944991842538766337\"}}"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":2481,"aggregated":"新token前20字符: eyJhbGciOiJFUzI1NiIs\n图片1上传结果: {\"code\":99991677,\"msg\":\"Authentication token expired. Please request a new one.\",\"error\":{\"log_id\":\"20260407225837C0092AFBC77127D22D65\",\"troubleshooter\":\"排查建议查看(Troubleshooting suggestions): https://open.feishu.cn/search?from=openapi&log_id=20260407225837C0092AFBC77127D22D65&code=99991677&method_id=6944991842538766337\"}}","cwd":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775573917868}}
{"type":"message","id":"d80ae311","parentId":"e22a40e9","timestamp":"2026-04-07T14:58:47.026Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Token还是过期的。batch_auth授权后可能需要用新的refresh_token来获取access token。让我检查一下Keychain里的token结构，看看是不是需要手动刷新。根据MEMORY.md的说明，token在Keychain里存的是完整JSON，包含accessToken和refreshToken。但我现在无法直接刷新，可能需要等待一段时间让系统自动更新，或者频哥需要重新授权一次。\n\n让我告诉频哥这个问题，需要他再次授权。","thinkingSignature":"58dbfeff0b20f8e40dc6de4f8114bbe04efe703eeee04705563d387f0046dc3c"},{"type":"text","text":"Token刷新后仍然过期。飞书API的access token有效期比较短，batch_auth授权后可能需要一些时间才能刷新成功。\n\n**目前情况：**\n- Access token已过期\n- 刷新后仍显示过期，可能需要重新授权流程\n\n**两个选择：**\n\n1. **先录入文字版错题**（不含图片），图片稍后补充\n2. **重新授权一次**（在飞书里再次确认授权）\n\n你想怎么处理？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":107967,"output":186,"cacheRead":40516,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":148669,"cost":{"input":0.0323901,"output":0.00022319999999999998,"cacheRead":0.00243096,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.03504426}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775573917894,"responseId":"06244e9efed91b1b86f056f3fcc87707"}}
