{"type":"message","id":"927e63b1","parentId":"bb3da461","timestamp":"2026-04-07T14:59:30.248Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"授权显示成功，但之前说已授权无需重复。这可能意味着token本身没过期，而是其他问题。让我再试一次上传。","thinkingSignature":"9377bd9b591639dabe2759ee5bf3d4f02297e8b1055c70592509e744e4d00859"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_uvgp5kcefo8a_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"sleep 3\nFULL_TOKEN=$(security find-generic-password -s \"openclaw-feishu-uat\" -a \"cli_a93534f5edb85bd3:ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\" -w 2>/dev/null)\nACCESS_TOKEN=$(echo \"$FULL_TOKEN\" | python3 -c \"import sys,json; d=json.load(sys.stdin); print(d.get('accessToken',''))\")\necho \"token: ${ACCESS_TOKEN:0:30}...\"\n\n# 上传图片1\nSIZE1=$(stat -f%z /tmp/geography_wrong1.jpg)\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/files/upload_all\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $ACCESS_TOKEN\" \\\n  -F \"file_name=geography_wrong1.jpg\" \\\n  -F \"parent_type=bitable_image\" \\\n  -F \"parent_node=TAxUbXUmKaXVuXsNWOacbP1Tne1\" \\\n  -F \"size=$SIZE1\" \\\n  -F \"file=@/tmp/geography_wrong1.jpg;type=image/jpeg\" \\\n  -F 'extra={\"bitablePerm\":{\"tableId\":\"Tbl8nVfnfFoGBVS\"}}'","timeout":30}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":108016,"output":350,"cacheRead":40516,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":148882,"cost":{"input":0.0324048,"output":0.00041999999999999996,"cacheRead":0.00243096,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.03525576}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775573962294,"responseId":"06244eca4b929999006984a9819eda1a"}}
{"type":"message","id":"bf9cb5c4","parentId":"927e63b1","timestamp":"2026-04-07T14:59:33.799Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_uvgp5kcefo8a_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"token: eyJhbGciOiJFUzI1NiIsImZlYXR1cm...\n{\"code\":99991677,\"msg\":\"Authentication token expired. Please request a new one.\",\"error\":{\"log_id\":\"20260407225933295A040C4678CB1CEC81\",\"troubleshooter\":\"排查建议查看(Troubleshooting suggestions): https://open.feishu.cn/search?from=openapi&log_id=20260407225933295A040C4678CB1CEC81&code=99991677&method_id=6944991842538766337\"}}"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":3464,"aggregated":"token: eyJhbGciOiJFUzI1NiIsImZlYXR1cm...\n{\"code\":99991677,\"msg\":\"Authentication token expired. Please request a new one.\",\"error\":{\"log_id\":\"20260407225933295A040C4678CB1CEC81\",\"troubleshooter\":\"排查建议查看(Troubleshooting suggestions): https://open.feishu.cn/search?from=openapi&log_id=20260407225933295A040C4678CB1CEC81&code=99991677&method_id=6944991842538766337\"}}","cwd":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775573973774}}
{"type":"message","id":"90b2b1a2","parentId":"bf9cb5c4","timestamp":"2026-04-07T14:59:48.203Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The token is still showing as expired. The issue is that `feishu_oauth_batch_auth` doesn't actually refresh the access token - it just confirms that the permissions are already granted. The actual access token might need to be obtained through a different flow.\n\nLooking at the MEMORY.md, there's a note about this: \"飞书权限卡片处理（2026-04-03 新增）\" - when encountering token issues, we should use feishu_oauth_batch_auth. But it seems this tool just re-confirms existing permissions, doesn't actually generate a new access token.\n\nThe access token stored in Keychain seems to be expired and not being refreshed automatically. This might require manual re-authentication through the OAuth flow which the user would need to initiate from their end.\n\nLet me try a different approach - using the feishu_im_bot_image tool to download the image first, then maybe there's another way to upload.\n\nActually wait, looking at the tools available:\n- feishu_im_bot_image - bot downloads image from Feishu message\n- feishu_im_bot_image is for downloading FROM Feishu messages\n\nThe issue is we need to upload TO Feishu Bitable. The current access token in Keychain is expired and the batch_auth doesn't seem to be refreshing it.\n\nLet me inform the user that this requires a more complete re-authentication flow. The token refresh might need user intervention on the Feishu side.","thinkingSignature":"99be9e0bfa09641b9410abc9c254da7b49700fac700e1eb8e40f669fa683a0dc"},{"type":"text","text":"Token仍然过期。batch_auth确认权限授权状态，但没有刷新access token。\n\n这个access token需要通过OAuth流程才能刷新。你可能需要：\n\n**在飞书里重新触发一次授权**（比如通过开放平台网页重新扫码），或者告诉我你是否可以通过其他方式刷新token。\n\n---\n\n**临时方案**：先录入文字版错题（不含图片），图片作为附件稍后再补。这样错题本不会空着。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":108507,"output":383,"cacheRead":40516,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":149406,"cost":{"input":0.0325521,"output":0.0004596,"cacheRead":0.00243096,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.03544266}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775573973800,"responseId":"06244ed6dbd78c63d57b8e59242d8236"}}
{"type":"message","id":"fa184d9e","parentId":"90b2b1a2","timestamp":"2026-04-07T15:00:22.919Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-07 23:00:21 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b52658e8500a4c2de849d1674985]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52658e8500a4c2de849d1674985\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-04-07 23:00 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n你帮我自动处理，我不想自己弄"}],"timestamp":1775574022891}}
{"type":"message","id":"cfffb342","parentId":"fa184d9e","timestamp":"2026-04-07T15:00:35.455Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"频哥希望我自动处理这个问题。但我需要解决token过期的问题。让我思考一下...\n\n根据之前的经验，access token过期可能是因为：\n1. token本身确实过期了（通常有效期不长）\n2. 可能需要通过refresh_token来刷新\n3. 或者需要用户重新授权\n\n但根据MEMORY.md里的记录，频哥的token存在macOS Keychain里。batch_auth似乎只是刷新了权限，但没有刷新access token。\n\n让我检查一下keychain里存的是什么。可能需要通过OAuth的refresh_token来获取新的access token。\n\n根据Get笔记skill文档，OAuth流程是自动处理的。但飞书API的access token是另一个问题。\n\n让我想想...飞书开放平台的access token通常：\n- 有效期是2小时（7200秒）\n- 可以通过refresh_token刷新\n- refresh_token有效期是30天\n\n如果access token过期但refresh_token还有效，可以自动刷新。\n\n问题是我不知道refresh_token在哪里，或者它是否还存在。\n\n根据之前的经验，可能需要用户手动在飞书开放平台重新授权。但频哥说他不想自己弄。\n\n让我再试一次oauth，看能否通过某种方式刷新token。\n\n或者我可以尝试使用feishu_oauth工具（撤销然后重新授权），但根据文档用户明确说\"不要调用revoke\"。\n\n\n我应该先查看飞书oauth相关的工具，看看是否有其他方式能解决这个问题。","thinkingSignature":"a99b66d4f602109c3223470a080700f34a7a37783b92173930d67621e485b083"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_n5xl6i485sxs_1","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"~/.openclaw/extensions/openclaw-lark/skills/feishu-troubleshoot/SKILL.md","limit":100}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":130,"output":331,"cacheRead":148543,"cacheWrite":650,"totalTokens":149654,"cost":{"input":0.000039,"output":0.0003972,"cacheRead":0.00891258,"cacheWrite":0.00024375000000000002,"total":0.009592529999999998}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775574022916,"responseId":"06244f077cf1058a7f06378008309236"}}
{"type":"message","id":"a2a1a279","parentId":"cfffb342","timestamp":"2026-04-07T15:00:35.608Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_n5xl6i485sxs_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: feishu-troubleshoot\ndescription: |\n  飞书插件问题排查工具。包含常见问题 FAQ 和深度诊断命令（/feishu_doctor）。\n\n  常见问题可随时查阅。诊断命令用于排查复杂问题（多次授权仍失败、自动授权无法解决等），\n  会检查账户配置、API 连通性、应用权限、用户授权状态，并生成详细的诊断报告和解决方案。\n\n---\n\n# 飞书插件问题排查\n\n## ❓ 常见问题（FAQ）\n\n### 卡片按钮点击无反应\n\n**现象**：点击卡片按钮后没有任何反应，然后提示报错.\n\n**原因**：应用未开通「消息卡片回传交互」权限。\n\n**解决步骤**：\n\n1. 登录飞书开放平台：https://open.feishu.cn/app\n2. 选择您的应用 → **事件与回调**\n3. 在回调配置中,修改订阅方式为\"长链接\"并添加回调 \"卡片回传交互\"(card.action.trigger)\n4. 创建应用版本 → 提交审核 → 发布\n\n---\n\n## 🔍 诊断命令（深度工具）\n\n**注意**：诊断命令仅用于排查复杂/疑难的**权限相关问题**。常规权限问题会自动触发授权流程，无需手动诊断。\n\n**何时使用诊断**：\n- 多次授权后仍然报错\n- 自动授权流程无法解决的问题\n- 需要查看完整的权限配置状态\n\n**使用方法**：\n\n在飞书聊天会话中直接输入（作为用户消息发送）：\n\n/feishu doctor\n\n诊断命令会检查：\n\n- **📋 诊断摘要**（首先展示）：\n  - 总体状态（✅ 正常 / ⚠️ 警告 / ❌ 失败）\n  - 发现的问题列表和简要描述\n\n- **环境信息**：\n  - 插件版本\n\n- **账号信息**：\n  - 凭证完整性（appId, appSecret 掩码）\n  - 账户启用状态\n  - API 连通性测试\n  - Bot 信息（名称和 openId）\n\n- **应用身份权限**：\n  - 应用已开通的必需权限数量\n  - 缺失的必需权限列表\n  - 一键申请链接（自动带上缺失权限参数）\n\n- **用户身份权限**：\n  - 用户授权状态统计（✓ 有效 / ⟳ 需刷新 / ✗ 已过期）\n  - Token 自动刷新状态（是否包含 offline_access）\n  - 权限对照表（应用已开通 vs 用户已授权，逐项对比）\n  - 应用权限缺失时的申请指引和链接\n  - 用户授权不足时的重新授权操作方法\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775574035586}}
