sk for clarification - should I delete the current record and only keep question (2), or is it okay as is?","thinkingSignature":"153280d1b25bb8c6030d2ae7f59dc8472be68a813a88fc4b51d1ae3435f8e6fc"},{"type":"text","text":"我刚才已经把3道题（5、6、2）都录在一起了。\n\n你现在说只录长江源头那道(2)，那需要我：\n1. **删除**刚才那条混合记录\n2. **重新录入**只含第(2)题\n\n要这样处理吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":130,"output":506,"cacheRead":40516,"cacheWrite":118945,"totalTokens":160097,"cost":{"input":0.000039,"output":0.0006072,"cacheRead":0.00243096,"cacheWrite":0.044604375,"total":0.047681535000000004}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775574390227,"responseId":"06245077f6ca6eaab0b63949f9d1131d"}}
